3. RAPIDITY OF THE CONSTANTS
============================================================

  Input x          Rapidity arctanh(x)     Q(x) = e^(2*rapidity)
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  1/phi (golden)           0.72181774            4.236068
  1/tau (tribonacci)       0.60937786            3.382976
  1/e                      0.38596842            2.163953
  1/pi                     0.32976531            1.933884
  1/sqrt(2)                0.88137359            5.828427
  1/sqrt(5)                0.48121183            2.618034
