============================================================

  H(T) = I(Omega(T), 2) = sum over independent sets of 2^|S|.
  The rapidity of H: phi_H = ln(H)/2.

  For the transitive tournament: H = 1, phi_H = 0 (at rest).
  For T_3 (3-cycle): H = 3, phi_H = ln(3)/2 = 0.549
  For T_7 (Paley): H = 189, phi_H = ln(189)/2 = 2.620
  For T_11 (Paley): H = 95095, phi_H = ln(95095)/2 = 5.728

  H-value    rapidity     notes
  --------------------------------------------------
       1      0.00000     transitive (at rest)
       3      0.54931     T_3 (3-cycle)
       5      0.80472     n=4 max
       7      0.97296     FORBIDDEN
       9      1.09861     n=5 Paley adjacency
      11      1.19895     n=5
