  Key compositions:
  1/3 (+) 1/5 = 0.5000000000 = 1/8 ???
  = (8/15)/(16/15) = 1/2 EXACTLY!

  THE OCTAVE VELOCITY COMPOSED WITH THE FIFTH VELOCITY
  GIVES v = 1/2 (rapidity = arctanh(1/2) = ln(3)/2 = rapidity of 3).
  Check: arctanh(1/3) + arctanh(1/5) = 0.5493061443
  arctanh(1/2) = 0.5493061443
